POCRTL_BUILD: %X10000001
VMSDEF_BUILD: %X10000001
VMSLIB_BUILD: %X10000001
SERVICEUSE built: %X10000001
$GETSYIW
version, hardware, CPU: SS$_NORMAL
  I/O status: SS$_NORMAL
  SYI$_VERSION |V5.5-2H4|
  SYI$_HW_NAME |VAXserver 3900 Series|
  SYI$_CPU 10, length 4
item 9999: SS$_BADPARAM
$GETDVIW
SYS$DISK: SS$_NORMAL
  I/O status: SS$_NORMAL
  DVI$_DEVCLASS is DC$_DISK: yes
  DVI$_DEVNAM |_DUA1:|
a mailbox
$CREMBX: SS$_NORMAL
$GETDVIW by channel: SS$_NORMAL
  DVI$_DEVCLASS is DC$_MAILBOX: yes, DVI$_DEVBUFSIZ 64
$QIOW write: SS$_NORMAL
  I/O status: SS$_NORMAL
$QIOW read: SS$_NORMAL
  I/O status: SS$_NORMAL
  read |a line through the mailbox|
$QIOW read, empty, IO$M_NOW: SS$_NORMAL
  I/O status: SS$_ENDOFFILE
$DASSGN: SS$_NORMAL
$DASSGN again: SS$_IVCHAN
$NUMTIM
16-OCT-2026 12:34:56.78: SS$_NORMAL
  2026 10 16 12 34 56 78
0: SS$_NORMAL
  1858 11 17 0 0 0 0
a delta of 3 04:00:00.00: SS$_NORMAL
  0 0 3 4 0 0 0
now: SS$_NORMAL
$FAO and $FAOL
!UL and !XL: SS$_NORMAL
   |42 and 000000FF|
!AS, !SL: SS$_NORMAL
   |a string, -42|
!%D, !UL: SS$_NORMAL
   |16-OCT-2026 12:34:56.78, 7|
$FAOL !UL and !XL: SS$_NORMAL
   |42 and 000000FF|
$ENQW and $DEQ on POC_SSTEST
A, EX, VALBLK: SS$_NORMAL
  in the lock status block: SS$_NORMAL
  A's lock id is not 0: yes
  value ||
B, EX, NOQUEUE: SS$_NOTQUEUED
B, CR, NOQUEUE: SS$_NOTQUEUED
B, NL: SS$_NORMAL
  in the lock status block: SS$_NORMAL
A converted to NL, VALBLK: SS$_NORMAL
  in the lock status block: SS$_NORMAL
B converted to PR, VALBLK: SS$_NORMAL
  in the lock status block: SS$_NORMAL
  value |from lock A|
C, NL, SYNCSTS: SS$_SYNCH
  in the lock status block: SS$_NORMAL
$DEQ A: SS$_NORMAL
$DEQ B: SS$_NORMAL
$DEQ C: SS$_NORMAL
$DEQ A again: SS$_IVLOCKID
$WAKE and $HIBER
$WAKE: SS$_NORMAL
$HIBER: SS$_NORMAL
$WAKE: SS$_NORMAL
$WAKE: SS$_NORMAL
$HIBER: SS$_NORMAL
Timers.Sleep(2000): SS$_NORMAL
  at least 1.5 seconds: yes
$WAKE POC_NO_SUCH: SS$_NONEXPR
$SETPRN
$GETJPIW: SS$_NORMAL
POC_SSTEST: SS$_NORMAL
  JPI$_PRCNAM |POC_SSTEST|
POC_SSTEST_LONG_: SS$_IVLOGNAM
a subprocess POC_SSDUP: SS$_NORMAL
POC_SSDUP: SS$_DUPLNAM
the first name again: SS$_NORMAL
  restored: yes
run: %X00000001
